	(descr "TI RTW (S-PWQFN-N24) 4 x 4 mm, 0.5 mm pitch. Land pattern: case_bq25895.pdf p.64 'Example Board Layout': pads 0.28 x 0.85 mm (outer span 4.8 mm), thermal land 2.6 x 2.6 mm (TI shows 3.1 mm, which touches the pin pads: its inner edge is 1.55 mm from the centre, the same as the pin pads' inner ends; 2.6 mm is the smallest exposed pad of the package, 2.7 +-0.1 mm on p.63, and leaves 0.2 mm to every pin pad) with 9 vias dia 0.3 mm on a 0.9 mm grid; paste: four 1.1 mm windows (stencil figure). Pin order p.62 (outline, bottom view) mirrored to the top view: pins 1 to 6 on the top row right to left, 7 to 12 on the left column, 13 to 18 on the bottom row, 19 to 24 on the right column. Exposed pad = pad 25 (TI numbers none; 25 = pin count + 1, requirement closed in open-pins.csv).")
